{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/382303-los-angeles-dead-gamers-society-at-strategicon-orc-con-feb-13-16","id":382303,"title":"Los Angeles: Dead Gamers Society at Strategicon: Orc Con Feb 13-16","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-26T14:11:02-08:00","id":382303,"title":"Los Angeles: Dead Gamers Society at Strategicon: Orc Con Feb 13-16","content":"The Dead Gamers Society will be on hand at Strategicon: Orc Con, this coming President's Day weekend, running a fine selection of WOD games.<br /> <br /> Strategicon is a Los Angeles based gaming convention held three times a year. Members of the DGS get a discount on pre-registration passes, via their website. To learn more about Strategicon or purchase a pass, visit their site at...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.strategicon.net\" target=\"_blank\">www.strategicon.net</a><br /> <br /> The Dead Gamers Society is a Los Angeles based World of Darkness RPG club, we organize and run open invite games throughout the region, to learn more about the DGS, visit our site at...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Or follow us on Facebook or Twitter at...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Dead-Gamers-Society/173659482300\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/y8/r/dF5SId3UHWd.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Dead-Gamers-Society/173659482300\" target=\"_blank\"> Log into Facebook </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Dead-Gamers-Society/173659482300\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.facebook.com/pages/Dead-Gamers-Society/173659482300 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Log into Facebook to start sharing and connecting with your friends, family, and people you know. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DeadGamersSoc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/457182491564974080/GnpEG2UE_400x400.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DeadGamersSoc\" target=\"_blank\"> Dead Gamers Society (@DeadGamersSoc) on X </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DeadGamersSoc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twitter.com/DeadGamersSoc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The Dead Gamers Society - Southern California's horror and dark fantasy tabletop RPG club. Dead gamers...do tell tales. #rpg #ttrpg #horror </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Our convention schedule is...<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Friday 2:00pm</b><br /> <br /> How An Angel Dies \u2013 Demon: The Descent GM: Louis Garcia<br /> You are unchained, once an angel, enacting the will of the God Machine. Now, you are fallen, defecting to the human race, hiding from the God Machine. You are now a demon. Yours is a world of false identities and clockwork conspiracies, stolen faces and hidden works of the Machine. You cannot and will not return to the sterile embrace of Heaven.<br /> <br /> <b>Friday 8:00pm</b><br /> <br /> Terror of Kuzilak - Mage: The Awakening GM: Steven Rodriguez<br /> A terrible demon from the abyss has been let loose on the sleeping world. Powerful Archmages come out of seclusion to permanently solve this ancient threat. Come play as some of the most enlightened beings in the multiverse and do battle on a cosmic scale!<br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 9:00am</b><br /> <br /> The Hunt \u2013 World of Darkness God Machine GM: Mike Cantin<br /> When a group of friends go out on a hunting expedition in the dead of winter, things get messy. It isn't the booze, nor the strained past, the ex....its the howling, and the blood. That they are now the hunted\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 2:00pm</b><br /> <br /> Saturnalia Act I Vampire the Requiem GM: Joe Burgos<br /> It is the Festival of Saturnalia, a time celebrated among with wild, orgiastic parties and topsy-turvy reversals in station. Lords becomes servants, slaves becomes masters, but only for one night. For the Kindred, who perpetually strive to outdo their mortal prey, this is the night when all rules are forgotten, when neonates become elders. So put on your party toga, it\u2019s going to be a wild night.<br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 8:00pm</b><br /> <br /> Blood Loss - Vampire: The Masquerade V20 GM: Louis Garcia<br /> San Francisco: The Camarilla is rocked by The Sabbat's uprising in the city and they are on the brink of collapse. Yet, the Anarch Movement watches from the sidelines. In secret, the Camarilla sends a coterie to the Anarch Movement, to negotiate an alliance, but what will the cost be?<br /> <br /> <b>Sunday 9:00am</b><br /> <br /> What Lurks Beneath The Stone - Dark Ages: Vampire GM: Mike Cantin<br /> The Tremere are not to be trusted. That\u2019s what they elders keep telling us. Now the Outlanders and the Haunts are going missing, and there are tales of winged terrors by moonlight. By Caine\u2019s wrath, we will seek the truth. And if these usurper devils be to blame, it will be by our hands that they greet the cleansing of the dawn.<br /> <br /> <b>Sunday 8:00pm</b><br /> <br /> All The Damn Vampires - Hunter: The Vigil GM: David and Julie Scott<br /> Every year, the bloodsuckers bankroll a Halloween Festival with carnival rides, food, acrobats and clowns. None of that\u2019s for the vampires themselves it\u2019s just bait for their prey \u2013 men, women, and children. Well, this year we\u2019re putting a stop to it. We\u2019re outnumbered but we have surprise on our hands and time to plan. This year, the vampires are the prey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":85,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","user":"Drumheller","date":". 01-26-2015, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}